# Generated documentation. `site/` is mkdocs' output. Under `docs/`, only the
# pages `scripts/build_docs.py` writes are ignored — listed individually rather
# than ignoring the whole directory, so a hand-authored page can be committed
# alongside the generated ones (the script no longer deletes what it did not
# create).
site/
/docs/.generated-pages
/docs/index.md
/docs/contributing.md
/docs/security.md
/docs/changelog.md
/docs/reference/
